#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/box_blur.rst:14
msgid "Box Blur"
msgstr "Okienko rozmazania"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/box_blur.rst:18
msgid ""
"Replaced by :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/"
"boxblur`. For more blurring effects see the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/blur_and_sharpen` chapter."
msgstr ""
"Nahradené :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/"
"boxblur`. Ďalšie efekty rozmazania nájdete v kapitole :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/box_blur.rst:22
msgid ""
"This is the `Boxblur <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/FilterBoxblur/"
">`__ MLT filter."
msgstr ""
"Toto je MLT filter `Boxblur <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/"
"FilterBoxblur/>`__."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/box_blur.rst:24
msgid "Separate horizontal and vertical blur."
msgstr "Oddelené horizontálne a vertikálne rozmazanie."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/box_blur.rst:26
msgid ""
"The unit for the boxblur \"hori\" and \"vert\" parameters is \"pixels\". For "
"each pixel in the image, the parameters indicate what pixels will be mixed "
"with it in order to create the blur effect. For example, if you set \"hori\" "
"to 5, then each pixel will be blurred with the sample that is 5 pixels away "
"on each side."
msgstr ""
"Jednotka pre parametre boxblur \"hori\" a \"vert\" je \"pixely\". Pre každý "
"pixel v obrázku parametre udávajú, ktoré pixely sa s ním zmiešajú na "
"vytvorenie efektu rozmazania. Napríklad, ak nastavíte \"hori\" na 5, každý "
"pixel sa rozmaže so vzorkou, ktorá je 5 pixelov ďaleko na každej strane."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/box_blur.rst:28
msgid "https://youtu.be/MBO-STDoj_Y"
msgstr "https://youtu.be/MBO-STDoj_Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/box_blur.rst:30
msgid ""
"Not 100% sure if this sample is Box Blur or Square Blur. The caption on this "
"sample was translated from Spanish. Original Spanish was \"Difuminar en "
"cuadro\".*"
msgstr ""
"Nie je 100% isté, či je táto ukážka Box Blur alebo Square Blur. Popis tejto "
"ukážky bol preložený zo španielčiny. Pôvodný španielsky text bol \"Difuminar "
"en cuadro\".*"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/box_blur.rst:32
msgid "https://youtu.be/0Q_BtThC-V0"
msgstr "https://youtu.be/0Q_BtThC-V0"

